Package: omahab-client
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Omahab Release <release@omahab.org>
Homepage: https://get.omahab.org
Description: Omahab companion daemon for desktop machines
 omahab-clientd is the user-level companion service: it authenticates with
 an Omahab server, verifies Tailscale state and instance identity, tracks
 projects and remote runners, enrolls Syncthing folders, serves the shell
 plugin over a local Unix socket, and launches Hermes Desktop and
 terminals. Install this package on the desktop machine, not on the
 server.
